Mail AI Assist\par
Copyright (c) 2026 Jin Lu\par
\par
This installs a local helper for the selected Windows user scope and folder. Each Windows user retains separate encrypted AI credentials. Install the Thunderbird add-on using the guide after setup. The helper checks for signed updates from GitHub Releases (lvbeck/mail-ai-assist) when used, at most once a day, and installs current-user updates after Thunderbird closes. All-user updates require a user action in Settings and administrator approval. Thunderbird updates the add-on separately. Uninstalling retains saved credentials.\par
